---
import ProjectLayout from "../../../layouts/ProjectLayout.astro";
---

<ProjectLayout
  title="Best Summer Programs — Competitions Pages"
  tocItems={[
    { id: "overview", label: "Overview" },
    { id: "problem", label: "Problem" },
    /*new*/ {id: "design-goal", label: "Design Goal"},
    /*new*/{id: "solution", label: "Solution"},
    { id: "features", label: "Design Features" },
    { id: "mobile", label: "Mobile" },
    /*new*/{ id: "takeaways", label: "Takeaways" },
  ]}
>

  <!-- HEADER ------------------------------------------------->
  <header id="overview" class="p-header" slot="header">
    <!-- <h1>Competitions Pages V2</h1> -->
    <div class="p-beat">
      <p class="p-beat-eyebrow tint-bsp">BestSummerPrograms</p>
      <h2 class="p-beat-heading">Guiding families and counselors through the complexities of <span class="tint-bsp">variable high school competitions</span>.</h2>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- HERO (full width) ----------------------------------->
  <img slot="hero" src="/images/BestSummerPrograms/CompetitionsPageHero.png" alt="BSP Placeholder">

  <!-- Problem -->
  <section id="problem">
    <div class="p-beat">
      <p class="p-beat-eyebrow">Context</p>
      <h2 class="p-beat-heading">Our team collected, and evaluated data on hundreds of high-school competitions, <span class="tint-problem">but our current layout overcomplicated the information for our users.</span></h2>
      <div class="p-beat-body">
        <p>Fields like deadlines and costs often had multiple values or conditions for competitions, creating inconsistent patterns across pages and lengthening our page scroll time.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="p-media-2col p-no-outline">
      <div class="p-not-mine">
        <img src="/images/BestSummerPrograms/CompetitionsPage_Old1.png" alt="old page design">
        <p class="caption"><strong>Landing lacked information</strong></p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-not-mine">
        <img src="/images/BestSummerPrograms/CompetitionsPage_Old2.png" alt="old page design">
        <p class="caption"><strong>Data fields lacked hierarchy</strong></p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-not-mine">
        <img src="/images/BestSummerPrograms/Competitions/Before_IssueZoom_1.png" alt="old page design">
        <p class="caption"><strong>Large lists overloaded our components</strong></p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-not-mine">
        <img src="/images/BestSummerPrograms/Competitions/Before_IssueZoom_2.png" alt="old page design">
        <p class="caption"><strong>Unnecessary urgency for our users</strong></p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </section>

  <section id="design-goal">
    <div class="p-beat">
      <p class="p-beat-eyebrow">Insights</p>
      <h2 class="p-beat-heading">Students, parents, and counselors each valued <strong>functionality, legibility,</strong> and<strong> transparency.</strong> <span class="tint-goal">So we redesigned a system to support those values</span>.</h2>
    </div>
<!-- 
    <div class="p-media">
      <div class="p-media-ph">Diagram of personas -> values</div>
    </div> -->

  </section>

  <section id="solution">
    <div class="p-beat">
      <p class="p-beat-eyebrow tint-goal">Solution</p>
      <h2 class="p-beat-heading"><span class="tint-goal">A new page format and component system</span> that makes our competition data more glanceable.</h2>
      <div class="p-beat-body">
        <p>Untangling our complex data through functional design patterns.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="p-media">
      <video autoplay loop muted playsinline>
        <source src="/images/BestSummerPrograms/CompetitionsPage_FullScroll.mov" type="video/mp4" />
      </video>
    </div>
    <div class="p-media">
      <img src="/images/BestSummerPrograms/Competitions_Components_2.png" alt="Design Zoom">
    </div>

  </section>

  <!-- Information Design -->
  <section id="features">
    <div class="p-beat">
      <p class="p-beat-eyebrow">1/4</p>
      <h2 class="p-beat-heading">Introducing our users to relevant information, transitioning from critical metadata to long-form descriptions.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="p-media">
      <img src="/images/BestSummerPrograms/CompetitionsPage_LayoutDiagram.png" alt="Landing">
      <p class="caption"><strong>Shortened banner and surfaced/emphasized key info.</strong></p>
    </div>


  <!-- Landing Page -->

    <div class="p-beat">
      <p class="p-beat-eyebrow">2/4</p>
      <h2 class="p-beat-heading">Upon landing, users are met with our expert anlayses through an overview card.</h2>
      <div class="p-beat-body">
        <p>To prevent our counselor-written summaries from being skipped, I displayed them through an overview card format as an easier entry point.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="p-media">
      <img src="/images/BestSummerPrograms/Competitions_Landing.png" alt="Landing">
      <p class="caption"><strong>Shortened banner and surfaced/emphasized key info.</strong></p>
    </div>


  <!-- Displaying Lists -->

    <div class="p-beat">
      <p class="p-beat-eyebrow">3/4</p>
      <h2 class="p-beat-heading">Prizes, deadlines, and fees are presented functionally for users to quickly scan, plan, and calculate.</h2>
    </div>


    <div class="p-media">
      <img src="/images/BestSummerPrograms/NewDataComponents.png" alt="detail">
      <p class="caption"><strong>Presenting listed information legibly and functionally </strong></p>
    </div>

    <!-- Displaying Lists -->

    <div class="p-beat">
      <p class="p-beat-eyebrow">4/4</p>
      <h2 class="p-beat-heading">Categorizing prizes by types to help users assess the value of each competition.</h2>
    </div>


    <div class="p-media">
      <img src="/images/BestSummerPrograms/Competitions/Feature_PrizesCategories.png" alt="Prize Component">
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- Mobile -->
  <section id="mobile">
    <div class="p-beat">
      <p class="p-beat-eyebrow">Mobile Design</p>
      <h2 class="p-beat-heading">Users are unblocked by information dense sections through compact modals, easily reaching all points of the page.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="p-media">
      <video autoplay loop muted playsinline>
        <source src="/images/BestSummerPrograms/CompetitionsPage_MobileCompatability.mov" type="video/mp4" />
      </video>
    </div>
  </section>

    <!-- Mobile -->
  <section id="takeaways">
  <hr class="p-divider"></hr>

    <div class="p-beat">
      <p class="p-beat-eyebrow tint-scope">Takeaway</p>
      <h2 class="p-beat-heading">Designing for our users meant choosing and advocating for the right data in the backend.</h2>
      <div class="p-beat-body">
        <p>This process involved communicating with our data team to shape our database intentionally, and avoiding overloading our users with irrelevant information.</p>
      </div>
    </div>


  </section>

</ProjectLayout>
